Own the end-to-end technical performance of a portfolio of strategic accounts across Latin America and Africa, focusing on approval rates, chargebacks, refunds, payouts, latency, and Share of Wallet growth;
Investigate payment performance changes and identify their root causes, including issuer behavior, decline-code mapping, 3DS authentication failures, retry logic, acquirer routing, and network-tokenization gaps;
