Strong experience in technical account management, solutions engineering, payments operations, or another client-facing technical role;
A curious and investigative mindset, with the initiative to explore data, challenge assumptions, and continue digging until the actual cause of an issue is identified;
Good working knowledge of SQL and the ability to query and analyze large datasets with autonomy; experience with BigQuery is a plus;
Working knowledge of the payments ecosystem, including authorization flows, acquiring, issuing, 3DS, tokenization, chargebacks, settlement, REST APIs, and webhooks;
Fluency in English and Portuguese, with the ability to communicate clearly with global stakeholders;
Ability to navigate effectively between technical and commercial audiences, translating engineering topics into clear business implications and recommendations;
Comfort working with incomplete information, managing ambiguity, and driving investigations forward;
Experience using AI tools to accelerate data investigation and documentation, combined with sound judgment about when outputs require further validation.

